<doc id="62846" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=62846" title="Dani Pedrosa">
Dani Pedrosa

<ol>
<li>ALIH</<li>
</ol>
Daniel "Dani" Pedrosa Ramal (lahir 29 &lt;a href="S%C3%A9pt%C3%A9mber"&gt;Séptémber&lt;/a&gt; 1985) nyaéta purah balab motor &lt;a href="Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing"&gt;Grand Prix&lt;/a&gt; urang &lt;a href="Spanyol"&gt;Spayol&lt;/a&gt;. Pedrosa tumuwuh di hiji désa deukeut &lt;a href="Sabadell"&gt;Sabadell&lt;/a&gt; nu disebut &lt;a href="Castellar%20del%20Vall%C3%A9s"&gt;Castellar del Vallés&lt;/a&gt;. Manéhna panggorana juara dunya balap motor &lt;a href="List%20of%20250cc/Moto2%20Motorcycle%20World%20Champions"&gt;Grands Prix 250cc&lt;/a&gt;. Pedrosa jangkungna 1.58 m sarta beurat 51 kg. Sanajan can kungsi juara dunya &lt;a href="MotoGP"&gt;MotoGP&lt;/a&gt;, Pedrosa geus dua belas kali meunang balapan noron dina usum (&lt;a href="2006%20Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing%20season"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;–&lt;a href="2017%20MotoGP%20season"&gt;2017&lt;/a&gt;). Manéhna ogé geus nganggeuskeun kajuaraan sabagé runner-up dina tilu usum (&lt;a href="2007%20Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing%20season"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="2010%20Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing%20season"&gt;2010&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="2012%20Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing%20season"&gt;2012&lt;/a&gt;).
<h2>Karir</h2>
Karir.
Dicokot pikeun pindah ka Kajuaraan Dunya sanggeus pinunjul di &lt;a href="Piala%20Activado%20Movistar"&gt;Piala Activado Movistar&lt;/a&gt; taun 1999, nyaéta salah sahiji seri pikeun ngamekarkeur bakat pamuda di &lt;a href="Spanyol"&gt;Spanyol&lt;/a&gt;, Pedrosa pindah ka panggung dunya dina taun 2001. Manéhna meunang dua kali dina taun 2002, terus lima kali meunang di Kajuaraan Dunya 125cc taun 2003.
<h3>125cc</h3>
125cc.
Pedrosa nyanghareupan taun katiluna di Kajuaraan Dunya 125cc kalayan katenangan jeung tekad, sakaligus tujuan ngahontal gelar juara. Salila usum ieu, manéhna mintonkeun saurang purah balap véteran —lain purah balap umur 18 taun—sarta manéhna meunang réputasi minangka salah sahiji pamuda purah balap ngora nu paling calakan dina olah raga balap motor. Manéhna jadi juara dunya 125cc di Malaysia, kalayan sésa balapan GP dua kali deui, sanggeus ngumpulkeun lima kameunangan sarta genep podium. Ngan saminggu ti harita, nasib sial tumiba,  manéhna garandapan kacilakaan parna mangsa sési latihan di GP Australia, nu ngabalukarkeun pigeulang sukuna potong duanana.
<h3>250cc</h3>
250cc.
Dina taun 2004, sanggeus cageur ditangtayungan ku méntor sarta &lt;a href="Alberto%20Puig"&gt;Alberto Puig&lt;/a&gt;, purah balap kasebut mutuskeun pikeun pindah ka kelas 250cc. Ti mimiti, Dani nganggap minangka usum diajar sarta adaptasi kalayan kelas, henteu ambisi pikeun ngahontal gelar juara. Dani ngasaan meunang balapan mimiti di Afrika Kidul sanggeus ngadu jajatén jeung &lt;a href="Randy%20De%20Puniet"&gt;Randy De Puniet&lt;/a&gt;, sarta ngarebut kajuaraan sanggeus Grand Prix Brasil, sarta bisa nahan nepi ka ahir usum. Di Australia, Pedrosa jadi juara dunya 250cc pangorana sapanjang sajarah. Hiji-hiji balapan di mana manéhna teu meunang podium nyaéta di Jerez (labuh keur hujan badag), Estoril jeung Phillip Island (anggeus di posisi kaopat).
Kalayan leuwih loba pangalaman jeung kadéwasaan, Dani nyanghareupan usum kadua 250cc nu beurat. Pasaingan nu kudu disanghareupan, kondisi cuaca nu butut di awal usum sarta tatu tak-tak nu dirandapaan mangsa latihan di GP &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt; taun 2005 robah jadi taun nu werit pikeun purah balap &lt;a href="Repsol%20Honda"&gt;Repsol&lt;/a&gt;, tapi antukna, kaunggulan peunteun 51 geus cukup pikeun ngahontal mahkota GP katilukalina di GP Australia di Phillip Island.
<h3>MotoGP</h3>
<h4>2006</h4>
MotoGP.
2006.
Dina panampilan kaopatna di &lt;a href="Balap%20motor%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;MotoGP&lt;/a&gt;, tanggal 14 &lt;a href="M%C3%A9i"&gt;Méi&lt;/a&gt; 2006 balapan di &lt;a href="Grand%20Prix%20China"&gt;Grand Prix China&lt;/a&gt;, manéhna mimiti meunang balapan.  Kameunangan ieu jadi pameunang pangorana (sarua jeung &lt;a href="Norick%20Abe"&gt;Norick Abe&lt;/a&gt;) di kelas utama, di tukangeun &lt;a href="Freddie%20Spencer"&gt;Freddie Spencer&lt;/a&gt;. Manéhna meunang balapan &lt;a href="Balap%20motor%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;MotoGP&lt;/a&gt; kaduakalina di &lt;a href="2006%20British%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Donington Park&lt;/a&gt; sarta jadi calon kuat pikeun Juara &lt;a href="Balap%20motor%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;MotoGP&lt;/a&gt;.
<h4>2007</h4>
2007.
Pedrosa terus balapan kalayan Honda di tahun &lt;a href="2007%20Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing%20season"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt; maké &lt;a href="Honda%20RC212V"&gt;Honda RC212V&lt;/a&gt; 800 cc nu anyar. Mesin mibanda masalah, sarta Pedrosa kasiap ku &lt;a href="Olivier%20Jacque"&gt;Olivier Jacque&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Randy%20de%20Puniet"&gt;Randy de Puniet&lt;/a&gt;, tapi manémhna nganggeuskeun usum ieu di posisi kadua di tukangeun &lt;a href="Casey%20Stoner"&gt;Stoner&lt;/a&gt; sarta di hareupeun &lt;a href="Valentino%20Rossi"&gt;Rossi&lt;/a&gt;. Manéhna néken kontrak 2 tahun &lt;a href="Repsol%20Honda"&gt;Repsol Honda&lt;/a&gt; pikeun taun 2008 jeung 2009.
<h4>2008</h4>
2008.
Dina taun &lt;a href="2008%20Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing%20season"&gt;2008&lt;/a&gt;, masalah Pedrosa kalayan &lt;a href="Honda%20RC212V"&gt;RC212V&lt;/a&gt; terus lumangsung nalikan manéhna ngalaman tatu dina pra usum sarta gagal dina pangujian pamekaran, tapi ngamimitian usum kalayan hadé kalayan ngahontal podium di babak mimiti. Performa &lt;a href="Michelin"&gt;Michelin&lt;/a&gt; di &lt;a href="Balap%20motor%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;MotoGP&lt;/a&gt; nyirorot butut, antukna Pedrosa pindah ka &lt;a href="Bridgestone"&gt;Bridgestone&lt;/a&gt; di babak &lt;a href="2008%20Indianapolis%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Indianapolis&lt;/a&gt;.
<h4>2009</h4>
2009.
Pedrosa di posisi ka 11 di babak mimiti, tapi kaséhatanna cageur di babak saterusna. Di babak kalima Pedrosa kacilakaan keur latihan sarta labuh mangsa balapan, nu ngalantarakeun kacék 33 peunteun di tukangeun pamingpin kajuaraan.
<h4>2010</h4>
2010.
Pikeun taun 2010, Pedrosa balik deui maké nomer 26 -nomer nu dipaké mangsa mimiti balap di &lt;a href="Balap%20motor%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;MotoGP&lt;/a&gt; - ti nomer 2 dina taun 2008 sarta nomer 3 dina taun 2009. Pedrosa mutuskeun ieu pikeun nyumponan panggemarna nu ngusulkeun maké nomer 26.
<h4>2011</h4>
2011.
Pedrosa tetep di tim &lt;a href="Repsol%20Honda"&gt;Repsol Honda&lt;/a&gt; kalayan ditambahan jadi tilu dina taun 2011, babarengan jeung &lt;a href="Andrea%20Dovizioso"&gt;Andrea Dovizioso&lt;/a&gt; sarta &lt;a href="Casey%20Stoner"&gt;Casey Stoner&lt;/a&gt;. Pedrosa naék podium dina pambukaan tilu balapan usum ieu, nu puncakna dina kameunangan di &lt;a href="2011%20Portuguese%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Grand Prix Portugal&lt;/a&gt; bulan Méi. Dina lap ka18 balapan di &lt;a href="2011%20French%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;France&lt;/a&gt;, Pedrosa kalibet dina hiji insidén jeung &lt;a href="Marco%20Simoncelli"&gt;Marco Simoncelli&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Gresini%20Racing"&gt;Gresini Racing&lt;/a&gt; mangsa tarung marebutkeun posisi kadua; &lt;a href="Simoncelli"&gt;Simoncelli&lt;/a&gt; nyiap Pedrosa di gurat luar asup ka Chemin aux Boeufs, tapi motong di hareupeun Pedrosa sarta balukarna, Pedrosa ngagodér gilinding tukang Simoncelli nu antukna labuh. Simoncelli dihukum penalti motong jalan, sedengkeun Pedrosa potong tulang salangka,
Pedrosa ngahontal kameunangan kaduana usum ieu di &lt;a href="2011%20German%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Grand Prix Jérman&lt;/a&gt;, sanggeus ngamangpaatkeun kasalahan &lt;a href="Jorge%20Lorenzo"&gt;Lorenzo&lt;/a&gt; kalayan sésa salapan lap dina balapan. Pedrosa di posisi katilu di &lt;a href="Laguna%20Seca"&gt;Laguna Seca&lt;/a&gt;, nu saacanna posisi pole mimiti usum ieu di &lt;a href="2011%20Czech%20Republic%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Grand Prix Céko&lt;/a&gt;. Di &lt;a href="2011%20Japanese%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt;, di mana paluang gelar di taun 2010 geus euweuh; sarta kacék hiji peunteun ti batur satimna &lt;a href="Andrea%20Dovizioso"&gt;Andrea Dovizioso&lt;/a&gt; pikeun posisi katilu di kajuaraan kasebut. &lt;a href="Andrea%20Dovizioso"&gt;Dovizioso&lt;/a&gt; anggeus di hareupeun Pedrosa di &lt;a href="2011%20Australian%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="2011%20Valencian%20Community%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Valencia&lt;/a&gt;, sedengkeun di &lt;a href="2011%20Malaysian%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Malaysia&lt;/a&gt; posisi pole Pedrosa, dibolaykeun lantaran &lt;a href="Simoncelli"&gt;Simoncelli&lt;/a&gt; maot dina balapan.
<h4>2012</h4>
2012.
Pedrosa tetep di &lt;a href="Repsol%20Honda"&gt;Repsol Honda&lt;/a&gt; dina usum 2012, babarengan deui jeung &lt;a href="Casey%20Stoner"&gt;Stoner&lt;/a&gt;. Manéhna meunang balapan usum kahijina di &lt;a href="2012%20German%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Grand Prix Jérman&lt;/a&gt;, meunang di &lt;a href="Sachsenring"&gt;Sachsenring&lt;/a&gt; pikeun taun katilu kali noron. Di &lt;a href="2012%20Italian%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Grand Prix Italia&lt;/a&gt;, geus dibéwarakeun yén Pedrosa geus néken kontrak dua tahun jeung tim &lt;a href="Repsol%20Honda"&gt;Repsol Honda&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="2013%20Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing%20season"&gt;2013&lt;/a&gt; ka hareup, sarta baris babarengan jeung &lt;a href="Marc%20M%C3%A1rquez"&gt;Marc Márquez&lt;/a&gt; juara Moto2.
Di &lt;a href="Grand%20Prix%20Aragon"&gt;Grand Prix Aragon&lt;/a&gt;, Pedrosa nyumponan syarat kadua tapi butuh kameunangan, sanggeus nyiap &lt;a href="Jorge%20Lorenzo"&gt;Lorenzo&lt;/a&gt; di lap tujuh; Hasilna ngamungkinkeun Pedrosa pikeun nutup kajuaraan pikeun 33 peunteun.
<h4>2013</h4>
2013.
Pedrosa tetep di &lt;a href="Repsol%20Honda"&gt;Repsol Honda&lt;/a&gt; usum &lt;a href="2013%20Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing%20season"&gt;2013&lt;/a&gt;, babarengan jeung &lt;a href="Marc%20M%C3%A1rquez"&gt;Marc Márquez&lt;/a&gt;, manéhna meunang balapan di &lt;a href="2013%20Spanish%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Spain&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="2013%20French%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;France&lt;/a&gt;, sarta &lt;a href="2013%20Malaysian%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Malaysia&lt;/a&gt; tapi tinggaleun di &lt;a href="2013%20German%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Jérman&lt;/a&gt;, lantaran tatu. Manéhna gagal ogé di &lt;a href="2013%20Aragon%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Aragon&lt;/a&gt; sanggeus pagodér jeung &lt;a href="Marc%20M%C3%A1rquez"&gt;Márquez&lt;/a&gt;.
<h4>2014</h4>
2014.
Kameunangan mimiti usum ieu di &lt;a href="2014%20Czech%20Republic%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Republik Céko&lt;/a&gt;, ngureunkeun kameunangan &lt;a href="Marc%20M%C3%A1rquez"&gt;Márquez&lt;/a&gt; nu noron 10 kali saprak awal usum.
<h4>2015</h4>
2015.
Pedrosa tetep di tim &lt;a href="Repsol%20Honda"&gt;Repsol Honda&lt;/a&gt; pikeun usum &lt;a href="2015%20Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing%20season"&gt;2015&lt;/a&gt;, sarta anggeus di posisi kagenep balapan bubuka di &lt;a href="2015%20Qatar%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Qatar&lt;/a&gt;. Saterusna, teu milu balap di &lt;a href="2015%20Motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix%20of%20the%20Americas"&gt;Texas&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="2015%20Argentine%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Argéntina&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="2015%20Spanish%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Spanyol&lt;/a&gt;, sabab milih pikeun ngubaran (operasi) leungeunna nu tatu. Pedrosa meunang podium mimiti di &lt;a href="2015%20Catalan%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Grand Prix Catalan&lt;/a&gt;, Pedrosa ngahontal kameunangan munggaran di usum ieu &amp;nbsp;– nu kalima puluh karirna, jadi purah balap kadalapan&amp;nbsp;– dina kondisi garing di &lt;a href="2015%20Japanese%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Motegi&lt;/a&gt;. Pedrosa nambah kameunangan kadua di &lt;a href="2015%20Malaysian%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Malaysia&lt;/a&gt;.
<h4>2016</h4>
2016.
Pedrosa tetep di tim &lt;a href="Repsol%20Honda"&gt;Repsol Honda&lt;/a&gt; pikeun usum &lt;a href="2016%20Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing%20season"&gt;2016&lt;/a&gt;. Sanajan hiji usum nu werit, manéhna bajoang maké gilinding &lt;a href="Michelin"&gt;Michelin&lt;/a&gt; sarta motor &lt;a href="Honda%20RC213V"&gt;RC213V&lt;/a&gt;, manéhna mampuh ngahontal kameunangan di satiap balapan sarta mampuh pikeun meunang balapan sahenteuna hiji balapan di masing-masing sabelas usum (2006-2016) yén manéhna geus kompetisi di kelas utama.
Pedrosa ngamimitian usum 2016 kalayan anggeus di pisisi kalima di &lt;a href="2016%20Qatar%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Qatar&lt;/a&gt;, sarta nempatan posisi lima badag purah balap ti tujuh rintakan balap di luar &lt;a href="2016%20Motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix%20of%20the%20Americas"&gt;Texas&lt;/a&gt; (tabrakan jeung &lt;a href="Andrea%20Dovizioso"&gt;Andrea Dovizioso&lt;/a&gt; nu ngalantarankeun teu anggeus balap). Hiji kacilakaan parna mangsa latihan bébas ka 2 di &lt;a href="2016%20Japanese%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Motegi&lt;/a&gt; cukang lantaran eureunna Pedrosa, kalayan tulang salangka katuhu jeung tulang suku katuhu rengat, sarta suku kénca nu ngabalukarkeun manéhna teu milu tilu balapan mangsa operasi badag ka 14 nambaan tatuna.
Pedrosa dikontrak neruskeun balap pikeun tim &lt;a href="Repsol%20Honda"&gt;Repsol Honda&lt;/a&gt; taun 2017 jung 2018.
<h3>Tatu</h3>
Tatu.
Throughout his World Championship career Pedrosa has been plagued by injuries that has often prevented him from cléan séasons that would allow a shot at the title with a high injury per crash ratio compared to other top riders.
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="2009%20Italian%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Balap motor Grand Prix Itali 2009&lt;/a&gt; (MotoGP) Incomplete fracture of the gréater trochanter of the right femur. A fracture without displacement, an injury that requires absolute rest and tréatment with painkillers.</li>
<li>2009 Désémber (MotoGP) Underwent an operation to remove a screw from his left wrist.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="2010%20Japanese%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Balap motor Grand Prix Jepang 2010&lt;/a&gt; (MotoGP) Four-fragment chip fracture of the left collarbone and a Grade 1 ankle sprain.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="2011%20French%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Balap motor Grand Prix Perancis 2011&lt;/a&gt; (MotoGP) Fractured right collarbone.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="2013%20German%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Balap motor Grand Prix Jérman 2013&lt;/a&gt; (MotoGP) Small fracture of left collarbone.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="2015%20Qatar%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Balap motor Grand Prix Qatar 2015&lt;/a&gt; (MotoGP) Arm pump of right hand.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="2016%20Japanese%20motorcycle%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Balap motor Grand Prix Jepang 2016&lt;/a&gt; (MotoGP) Fracture of right collarbone consisting of four fragments, requiring surgery (the 14th major surgery of his career). Subcapital fracture of the right fibula with no displacement, requiring only immobilization. Fracture to the fourth metatarsal of the left foot.</li>
</ul>
