<doc id="62847" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=62847" title="Honda RC213V">
Honda RC213V

Honda RC213V nyaéta motor balap nu dimekarkeun pikeun balapan di &lt;a href="Balap%20motor%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;MotoGP&lt;/a&gt; pikeun usum &lt;a href="Balap%20motor%20Grand%20Prix%20usum%202012"&gt;2012&lt;/a&gt; jeung saterusna. Tetekon pikeun taun 2012 ngidinan kapasitas mesin nepikeun ka 1000 cc, kalayan lobana kelép diwates 4 siki sarta maksimal liang sehér 81mm.
Ngaran modél dumasar kana:
<ul>
<li>RC= Awalan balap tradisional Honda pikeun motor 4-Tak</li>
<li>213= Motor karya mimiti dina abad ka-21.</li>
<li>V= &lt;a href="Mesin%20V"&gt;Mesin V&lt;/a&gt;</li>
</ul>
<h2>Sajarah</h2>
Sajarah.
Dina taun &lt;a href="Balap%20motor%20grand%20Prix%20usum%202012"&gt;2012&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Repsol%20Honda"&gt;Honda&lt;/a&gt; nurunkeun dua rupa RC213V pabrikan, dipaké ku tim &lt;a href="Repsol%20Honda"&gt;Repsol Honda&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Casey%20Stoner"&gt;Casey Stoner&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Dani%20Pedrosa"&gt;Dani Pedrosa&lt;/a&gt;; nu katilu jeung nu kaopat dipaké ku &lt;a href="%C3%81lvaro%20Bautista"&gt;Álvaro Bautista&lt;/a&gt; ti tim &lt;a href="Gresini%20Racing"&gt;Gresini Racing&lt;/a&gt; sarta &lt;a href="Stefan%20Bradl"&gt;Stefan Bradl&lt;/a&gt; ti tim &lt;a href="Team%20LCR"&gt;LCR&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Jonathan%20Rea"&gt;Jonathan Rea&lt;/a&gt;, ogé milu balap di dua &lt;a href="Balap%20motor%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;Grand Prix&lt;/a&gt; ngaganti purah balap &lt;a href="Casey%20Stoner"&gt;Casey Stoner&lt;/a&gt; lantaran kacilakaan di Indianapolis.
Dina mangsa tés saacan usum mimiti &lt;a href="Dani%20Pedrosa"&gt;Pedrosa&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Casey%20Stoner"&gt;Stoner&lt;/a&gt; mangrupa pangpunjulna maké Honda RC213V anyar.
Kalayan gabungan usaha maranéhna, purah balap &lt;a href="Repsol%20Honda"&gt;Repsol Honda&lt;/a&gt; meunang 12 kali balapan tina 18, sarta ngahontal juara purah balap ka 2 jeung ka 3, Honda RC213V mimiti ngahontal juara kahiji konstruktor, dina taun mimiti tetekon mesin 1000cc.
Dina taun &lt;a href="Balap%20motor%20Grand%20Prix%20usum%202013"&gt;2013&lt;/a&gt;, juara dunya &lt;a href="Moto2"&gt;Moto2&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Marc%20M%C3%A1rquez"&gt;Marc Márquez&lt;/a&gt; ngaganti &lt;a href="Casey%20Stoner"&gt;Casey Stoner&lt;/a&gt; di tim &lt;a href="Repsol%20Honda"&gt;Repsol Honda&lt;/a&gt;, sarta ngahontal juara dunya maké motor Honda RC213V. &lt;a href="Dani%20Pedrosa"&gt;Dani Pedrosa&lt;/a&gt; juara katilu, sarta Honda RC213V ngahontal juara konstruktor kadua kalina dina taun kadua.
Dina taun &lt;a href="Balap%20motor%20Grand%20Prix%20usum%202014"&gt;2014&lt;/a&gt;, mangsa tés mimiti saacan usum balap di &lt;a href="Sepang%20International%20Circuit"&gt;Sepang&lt;/a&gt; Honda RC213V jadi pinunjul waktu panngancangna, kalayan para purah balapna aya di posisi ka 1, ka 3, ka 5 sarta ka 6 dina poé mimiti tés di Sepang sarta posisi ka 1, ka 2, ka 3 sarta ka 9 dina poé kadua.
<h2>Produk balap</h2>
<h3>RCV1000R</h3>
Produk balap.
RCV1000R.
Tanggal 7 Nopémber 2013 &lt;a href="Honda%20Racing%20Corporation"&gt;HRC&lt;/a&gt; ngawanohkeun &lt;a href="Honda%20RCV1000R"&gt;RCV1000R&lt;/a&gt; nu baris dipaké mimiti taun 2014 di kelas "kabuka" &lt;a href="Balap%20motor%20Grand%20Prix"&gt;MotoGP&lt;/a&gt;. Opat purah balap baris balap maké &lt;a href="Honda%20RCV1000R"&gt;RCV1000R&lt;/a&gt; taun 2014, &lt;a href="Nicky%20Hayden"&gt;Nicky Hayden&lt;/a&gt; sarta masih kudu dikonfirmasi purah balap kadua di &lt;a href="Tim%20Aspar"&gt;Tim Aspar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Scott%20Redding"&gt;Scott Redding&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Tim%20Gresini%20Honda"&gt;Tim Gresini Honda&lt;/a&gt;) sarta &lt;a href="Karel%20Abraham"&gt;Karel Abraham&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Tim%20Cardion%20AB"&gt;Tim Cardion AB&lt;/a&gt;). &lt;a href="Casey%20Stoner"&gt;Casey Stoner&lt;/a&gt; purah balap &lt;a href="Repsol%20Honda"&gt;HRC&lt;/a&gt; nu dua kali Juara Dunya geus mecakan &lt;a href="Honda%20RCV1000R"&gt;RCV1000R&lt;/a&gt; sarta ngedalkeun hal nu positif ka insinyur &lt;a href="Honda%20Racing%20Corporation"&gt;HRC&lt;/a&gt;. Sasis &lt;a href="Honda%20RCV1000R"&gt;RCV1000R&lt;/a&gt; dumasar kana Honda RC213V, sarta mesin 90º V4 nu ngahasilkeun tanaga leuwih ti 235hp dina 16.000 rpm, kalayan migunakeun kelép pér sarta gear box tradisional.
<h3>RC213V-RS</h3>
RC213V-RS.
Pikeun usum balap taun &lt;a href="2015%20Grand%20Prix%20motorcycle%20racing%20season"&gt;2015&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Honda%20RCV1000R"&gt;Honda RCV1000R&lt;/a&gt; diganti ku &lt;a href="Honda%20RC213V-RS"&gt;Honda RC213V-RS&lt;/a&gt;, migunakeun kelép pneumatik tapi henteu migunakeun seamless shift gearbox. Honda RC213V-RS dasarna mah nyaéta mesin pabrikan taun ieu nu dipaké ku juara dunya &lt;a href="Marc%20M%C3%A1rquez"&gt;Marc Marquez&lt;/a&gt; tanpa migunakeun seamless shift gearbox sarta kudu maké &lt;a href="Electronic%20Control%20Unit"&gt;ECU&lt;/a&gt; standar nu disadiakeun ku &lt;a href="Dorna%20Sports"&gt;Dorna&lt;/a&gt;.
